qemu72-git-submodule.sh is an unmodified test fixture from QEMU commit
b67b00e6b4c7831a3f5bc684bc0df7a9bfd1bd56, scripts/git-submodule.sh:
https://github.com/qemu/qemu/blob/b67b00e6b4c7831a3f5bc684bc0df7a9bfd1bd56/scripts/git-submodule.sh
The fixture is GPL-2.0-or-later, as stated in its upstream header.
It exercises the actual upstream status/validate protocol with local temporary
Git repositories. It is not an emulator or an instruction-semantic fixture.
